Java Application and Class Basics,Method Naming Convention,"Inside a class, write a method definition that follows the standard Java naming convention for methods (e.g. camelCase)."
Java Application and Class Basics,Field Naming Convention,"Inside a class, declare a field that follows the standard Java naming convention for variables (e.g. camelCase)."
