Java Application and Class Basics,Make it an Application,"You have a class named `MyTask`. Add the necessary method to make it a runnable application."
Java Application and Class Basics,Role of Curly Braces,"In a class definition, what is the purpose of the opening `{` and closing `}` curly braces?"
Java Application and Class Basics,Blueprint Analogy,"In a comment, explain in one sentence how a Java class is like a blueprint for a house."
Java Application and Class Basics,Invalid Class Name,"Explain why `public class 2Go {}` is not a valid class declaration."
